WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Tirzepatide
How do two hormones shape appetite?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
After a meal, your gut releases GIP and GLP-1.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.200
Tirzepatide mimics both signals and can reduce appetite.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Read the tirzepatide guide at vetud.com.
